	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Gratia Christi tecum.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Recepi librum tuum, vir <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>doctissime, de gratia dei, quo me pro tua <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>solita humanitate donasti, die iulii 20.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z4"/>Hodie quoque libri scribę et <persName ref="p3273">Ulstettero</persName>, qui <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>parochus est in rure, magno in pago, <placeName>Gebs<lb xml:id="p1z6"/>heim</placeName>, redditi sunt.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Legi praefationem ad Dan<lb xml:id="p1z7"/>orum regem; utinam legerent principes deique <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>filium dominum nostrum Iesum Christum exoscularentur, <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>ne verborum lenociniis, item variis <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>et peregrinis papistarum a vero abducerentur.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z11"/>At quotus quisque ista audit resipiscens?</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z12"/>Videmus eos, qui rerum potiuntur, tametsi dei <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>filium constanter confiteantur, factis negare.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z14"/>Is, qui nobis pręlatus est, a reditu nunc brevi <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>incępit publice scortari, corradere etiam et nummos <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>emungere ab iis, qui pecunia ipsi laborant, per phasque <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>nefasque; secure et pręlicenter vivit.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Parum curę <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>sunt ecclesię et sancti ministri etc. etc.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Et quid dico?</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z19"/>Vide, domine, et iudica causam tuam.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">At videbit, <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>ni fallor, brevi exurgens veniensque ad nos <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>cum gloria et maiestate suos electos potenter <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>liberaturus.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Fiat, fiat.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Amen.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z23"/>Optarim omnes Germanicas conciones tuas <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>ac fratrum a <persName ref="p1227">Froschovero</persName> colligi unoque libro <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>imprimi; certe a pluribus distraherentur.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z26"/>Nullus est iam bibliopola, qui huc novos <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>advehat libros.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Quirinum puto iamdudum <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>morte interceptum; <persName>Wilhelmus <span type="pronoun">ille</span> Gallus</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z29"/><placeName ref="l28">Basiliensis</placeName> iam morbo et senio exantlatus <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>cessavit.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Si quispiam ad nos nonnunquam novos <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>portaret libros, a fratribus emerentur etc.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z32"/>Marchionem <persName ref="p8371">Albertum</persName> aiunt transisse <placeName ref="l28">Basileam</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>cum 6 equitibus incognitum, <placeName ref="l41">Bernę</placeName> cognitum, sed <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>sine honore dimissum.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Contendit ad <persName>Gallum</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Quo vero in statu sit mea incolumitas, <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>sic accipe: tumor ille, qui aliquot menses occupavit <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>pedes, deinde ventriculum, tandem, <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>dum medicorum opera me liberandum sperarem, totum per<lb xml:id="p2z5"/>vasit corpus, paucis tamen diebus, ut de me actum <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>putaverim.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">Atqui benignus deus sua solita clementia <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>me respitiens molestissimum tumorem, qui non <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>sinebat vel edere vel quiete dormire, actututm <lb xml:id="p2z9"/>abstulit, intra octiduum scilicet.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Nunc <lb xml:id="p2z10"/>scipioni innixus in aedibus expatior.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la">Quodsi <lb xml:id="p2z11"/>pedes suo offitio non defuerint debilitatemque corporis pro vir<lb xml:id="p2z12"/>ili iuverint, intra mensem forte intrabo in templum <lb xml:id="p2z13"/>domini paean cum s. <persName>Ezechia</persName> deo optimo maximo d<lb xml:id="p2z14"/>icturus.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la">Dein in apricum prodiens ad veteres <lb xml:id="p2z15"/>meos congerrones magnalia dei praedicabo.</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell"><lb xml:id="p2z16"/>Hisce vale.</s>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="de">22. iulii 1554.</s>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutant te nostri.</s>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><lb xml:id="p2z17"/>Salutabis tuos symmistas, <persName ref="p8127">Pellicanum</persName> inprimis, qui et macrobius <lb xml:id="p2z18"/>est atque ego.</s>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Iterum vale.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="la">Ex <placeName ref="l411">Richenvilla</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="31" xml:lang="la">Tuus ille ipsissimus <persName ref="p1010">Erbius</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="32" xml:lang="la">Eximio viro d. <persName ref="p495">Henrycho <lb xml:id="p2z19"/>Bullingero</persName>, antistiti summo <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinorum</placeName>, suo domino ac f<lb xml:id="p2z20"/>ratri charissimo etc. ad manus.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
